      "text": "🔴 INTERNATIONAL MUTUAL AID LIST\nPlease share if you can.\n\nONE DAY LEFT for Amazon sales, find your favourite wishlist or one you've never bought from before and send someone a gift! ❤️‍🔥\n\n🚨🚨🚨\n\n🇨🇺 Cuba – Medical masks for healthcare workers (~40,000 needed)\nOrganizer: @GoodVibePolitik (James)\n\n@_Old2shoes Essentials (antihistamines, magnesium, TP, paper towels) – Amazon wishlist + registry: https://t.co/2BSfyRdO8n\n\n@froglet80 : just lost my camp of 5 years and most of my belongings. Semi housed, for now.  Still disabled.  Anything helps. \nhttps://t.co/uV3gNBjwxO\nhttps://t.co/m4q0QzGvpL\n\nAll are welcome in my thread also\n\n⸻\n\n🇺🇸 UNITED STATES\n\n@hooraydhd (lunabluhma) – $3,542.91 – Urgent bills (power shut-off notice)\n@PenGwenWithLC – ~see profile! \n@MyMutualMermaid (Angel) – $300 –  (chronically ill, urgent)\n@lovealltrans (TLove) – $50 – Medicines (urgent)\n@KyPeterson91 (Ky Peterson) – $1,200 – Displaced after house fire, needs hotel \n\n@princesshoped – $200 electric + $500 medical / eyeglasses\n\n🚨 URGENT\nAreanna (@ThatsAllAreanna) – Food for 4 kids + shelter due daily\n\n@SpoonieStella – see profile! \n\n@NatalyNicole_ – Survival funds\n@The_Great_Null – See profile! \n@brownskingirlsm (KiKi) – Facing eviction, respiratory illness 🌞\n@amkd051 – $38 – Shelter for mother and daughter (freezing weather)\n\n⸻\n\n🇬🇧 UNITED KINGDOM\n\n@christianm1988 (crispy) – £100 – Emergency food (diabetic risk)\n\n⸻\n\n🇵🇸 PALESTINE / GAZA\n\n@Yara_and_cats – See profile 💙💙💙 urgent! 🚨\n\n@Rehamhelu – Chuffed campaign - see profile \n@MirasFamilyGaza – $850 – Rent urgently due (GoFundMe in profile)\n@mhmmdalna (Doaa Mohammed) – Survival fund (<$500 raised) – shelter, food, medical\n@DalalIsmail46704 (Dalal Ismail) – Family food support\n@mhmmd_tarig (Muhammad Tariq) – Mutual aid request\n\n@AboJamil97_alt (Shady | A Father’s Fight) – Child urgent heart surgery\n\n@NurseSondos (Sondos) – $150 – Treatment for mother in severe pain\n@AlmasriLsm88251 (Esmail) – Ongoing survival support\n\n@Arkan_Gaza (Arkan al-Masri) – Family food support\n@m_shwyl49067 (Ahmed from Gaza) – Family of 11 – Shelter + basic necessities\n\n@aghar_hamed (Dr. Layat) – Post-hospital recovery support\n@so69415 (Sozan) – $200 – Battery/power (no electricity, urgent)\n\n@AlmsrySlah44820 (Salah) – $200 urgent basic needs\n@Layat1999 (Mohanad) – Child burn treatment + family support\n@OdayMohamm65286 (Oday Mohammed) – Family support\n@toot3577088 (Karim) – Family of 15 – Food + cancer medication\n@gaza_bilal – $350 burn medication\n@israaJamal91 (Israa) – Family rebuilding campaign\n@abw27916 (Shadi) – Family support\n@SanaAzzam2000 (Sanaa) – $50 – Heart medication for father\n@Radwan05491 – Food support\n@Hady_moin – Ongoing campaign\n@alathamnaa – Free health tent\n\n🌞 @YSaidibrah32254 (Yousef) – Baby milk, diapers & medicine\n🌞 @IGaza72496 (Ismail) – $200 medication for critically ill sister\n\n⸻\n\n🌍 OTHER\n\n@molamcham – Food support for family\n@queerAmira – Nabirye grandmother medical support (Uganda) 🇺🇬\n\n⸻\n\n🌎 ADDITIONAL MUTUAL AID\n\n@Jnlyyyn89456 (JHO) – ~$700 – Rent, phone/internet, groceries for single mom and kids\n@hyperverbal_lee – See pinned – urgent needs\n@randwriter – See profile – mutual aid request\n\n🚨🚨🚨🇵🇭 PHILIPPINES – URGENT\n@jujupaupau – chemo bill for mom please see profile for update 🚨🚨🚨\n⸻\n\n🤝 ROHINGYA COMMUNITY\n\n@RohingyaRCP – Rohingya Community Partners\n@Rhi1012946Rhi – Rohingya Humanitarian Initiative (RHI)\n\nSee profiles to help! \n\n⸻\n\n🇨🇦🇵🇸\nHelp us build a legal front for the defense of Palestinian rights in Canada!\n\nThe Legal Centre for Palestine is a not-for-profit organization using the law as a tool to safeguard and advance Palestinian rights in Canada and beyond. Donations are urgently needed to help the Centre build legal power to take on systems steeped in anti-Palestinian racism and relentlessly pursue justice for our community.  Donate: https://t.co/Wd4r4eaDJE",
